{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37339","headline":"游阳明洞呈王理得诸君 · 唐彦谦","name":"游阳明洞呈王理得诸君","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"禹穴苍茫不可探，人传灵笈锁烟岚。\n初晴鹤点青边嶂，欲雨龙移黑处潭。\n北斗斋坛天寂寂，东风仙洞草毵毵。\n堪怜尹叟非关吏，犹向江南逐老聃。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"唐彦谦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37339.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37339","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}